OL,3,GNEWSARail disruption after signalling
OL,4,Acable theft
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrain passengers face disruption
OL,7,Fthroughout rush hour after signalling
OL,8,Fcables were stolen.
OL,10,FNational Rail said the cables were
OL,11,Fstolen from Hitchin in Hertfordshire on
OL,12,FWednesday night.
OL,14,FServices that travel between London and
OL,15,FPeterborough and Royston, including
OL,16,FLNER, Great Northern and Thameslink
OL,17,Fservices, could be affected.
OL,19,FDisruption is expected until 11:00 BST,
OL,20,FNational Rail said.
